@startuml
title Startseite aufrufen - Alle Projekte abrufen

actor "User" as user
participant "Browser/\nFrontend" as browser
participant "Express\nRouter" as router
participant "Homeview\nService" as service
database "PostgreSQL\nDatenbank" as db

== Initialisierung ==

user -> browser: Öffnet Startseite
activate browser

browser -> router: GET /api/homeview\n?sortBy=updatedAt&sortOrder=desc
activate router

router -> router: Validierung\nQuery-Parameter
note right: express-validator\nprüft search, status, sortBy etc.

== Service Layer ==

router -> service: getStartPageData(filters)
activate service

== Daten laden ==

service -> db: project.findMany()\ninclude: projectPlan, businessUnderstanding,\nProjectCategory\norderBy: updatedAt desc
activate db
note right: WHERE-Klausel filtert dynamisch\nnach Suchbegriff und Status
db --> service: projects[]
deactivate db

== Daten aufbereiten ==

service -> service: projects.map()\n- wizardProgress & taskProgress berechnen\n- category-Objekt extrahieren
service -> service: Statistiken aggregieren\n- totalProjects, planning,\n  inProgress, etc.

== Response zurückgeben ==

service --> router: {\n  projects[],\n  statistics,\n  totalCount\n}
deactivate service

router --> browser: HTTP 200 OK\nJSON Data (ohne Wrapper)
deactivate router

browser -> browser: Projekte rendern\n- Liste inkl. Status & Kategorien anzeigen\n- Filter/Sortierung anwenden

browser --> user: Startseite mit\nProjektübersicht
deactivate browser

@enduml
